{"seq":3,"slug":"effective-overlap-conflict-and-rollback","title":"生效重叠冲突与回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-version-effective/effective-overlap-conflict-and-rollback","wordCount":3626,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"生效重叠冲突与回滚\">生效重叠冲突与回滚</h1><p>一旦价格表按生效期建模，同一主键（SKU × 渠道 × 币种 × 客户层级）下就会存在多行，每行占一个时间区间。只要有两行的区间在同一时刻都声称&quot;我说了算&quot;，系统就不再有唯一的取价答案。这种状态不会自然消失：它产生于两个人分别提交、两次导入先后到达、或一次批量调价跨过了年度边界。真正的问题不是&quot;要不要允许重叠&quot;，而是<strong>重叠在什么时候被拒绝、被裁决，以及裁决错了怎么退回来</strong>。</p>\n<p>本文讨论三个相互咬合的问题：重叠如何被形式化定义并检测、冲突如何被有损/无损地消解、以及当一次已经生效的价格必须撤回时，回滚应当表达成什么语义、走什么执行路径、留下什么证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-冲突-消解-回滚\">核心概念：冲突、消解、回滚</h2><p>三个词在本文有严格分工。<strong>冲突（conflict）<strong>是同一主键下两个生效区间对同一时刻都声称有效，是一个</strong>可判定的几何事实</strong>，由区间关系唯一确定，与业务意图无关。**消解（resolution）**是把冲突变成唯一答案的动作，分两层：存储层的区间不变量（拒绝重叠）与取价层的优先级函数（在跨层候选间选一个）。<strong>回滚（rollback）<strong>是发现已生效的价格错误后恢复正确语义的过程，它的关键性质是</strong>不抹除历史</strong>——回滚产出新版本，而非删除旧版本。</p>\n<p>三者的依赖方向是单向的：没有可判定的冲突定义，消解规则无从对齐；没有分离的版本与快照，回滚就退化成&quot;改数据&quot;而失去可证性。后文按这个顺序展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突的四种形态-不是所有重叠都一样严重\">冲突的四种形态：不是所有重叠都一样严重</h2><p>把&quot;重叠&quot;当成单一缺陷，是检测器做不准的根源。按可判定性区分，同一主键下的区间冲突有四类，处理成本完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>几何关系</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>完全重叠</strong></td>\n<td>两行区间逐点相同</td>\n<td>重复导入同一文件、并发提交同一调价</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>主键/排斥约束在提交时直接拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>部分重叠</strong></td>\n<td>区间相交但互不包含</td>\n<td>两次调价的时间窗相互咬合</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>必须人工裁决，机器无法推断意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>边界相接</strong></td>\n<td><code>[1/1, 2/1)</code> 与 <code>[2/1, 3/1)</code></td>\n<td>常规相邻生效，<strong>不是冲突</strong></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>正确写法，检测器不得误报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>跨层遮蔽</strong></td>\n<td>区间不重叠，但同属一条优先级链</td>\n<td>渠道价与区域价、特价与标准价</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要优先级规则而非区间约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四类最容易被漏掉。渠道专属价 <code>[1/1, 4/1)</code> 与区域基准价 <code>[3/1, 6/1)</code> 在区间上并不相交，但它们共同覆盖了 3 月到 4 月这段时间——系统必须在取价时按优先级挑一个，而不能报&quot;无价&quot;。这与 SAP 定价条件中&quot;访问序列（access sequence）&quot;逐级回退的思想同源：条件记录按 <code>valid from</code> / <code>valid to</code> 存储，取价时按单据日期逐级查找，先命中者胜（<a href=\"https://help.sap.com/docs/SAP_S4HANA_ON-PREMISE\">SAP Help Portal, Condition Records</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>边界相接不应被误报为冲突</strong>，这是半开区间记法的直接收益。新手常写成闭区间 <code>[from, to]</code>，于是 1 月 31 日结束和 2 月 1 日开始的两行在午夜产生 1 秒的重叠或 1 天的空隙。统一采用左闭右开 <code>[valid_from, valid_to)</code>，结束日即&quot;失效时刻&quot;，相邻区间自然无缝且不重叠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检测模型-半开区间-排斥约束与提交时校验\">检测模型：半开区间、排斥约束与提交时校验</h2><p>检测的正确性可以用一行布尔条件概括。对同主键下任意两行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=[a_1,a_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=[b_1,b_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，重叠当且仅当：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1 &lt; b_2 \\ \\wedge \\ b_1 &lt; a_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这里是<strong>严格不等</strong>。若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span>，边界相接会被判成冲突；若两行中某行是开区间（无失效日，代表&quot;长期有效&quot;），需把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 代入，或显式用 <code>NULL</code> 语义处理——这正是实现中最常见的坑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[提交价格变更] --&gt; B{主键是否已存在活跃行}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[直接插入]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[对同主键求区间交集]&#10;  D --&gt; E{相交的候选行}&#10;  E --&gt;|无| F[插入成功]&#10;  E --&gt;|有| G{是边界相接吗}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| F&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H{是否声明了替代关系}&#10;  H --&gt;|压盖 supersede| I[先关闭旧行&lt;br/&gt;再插入新行]&#10;  H --&gt;|未声明| J[拒绝并返回&lt;br/&gt;冲突候选列表]&#10;  I --&gt; K[记录关联ID&lt;br/&gt;审计可回溯]&#10;  J --&gt; L[进入人工裁决队列]\">graph TD\n  A[提交价格变更] --&gt; B{主键是否已存在活跃行}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[直接插入]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[对同主键求区间交集]\n  D --&gt; E{相交的候选行}\n  E --&gt;|无| F[插入成功]\n  E --&gt;|有| G{是边界相接吗}\n  G --&gt;|是| F\n  G --&gt;|否| H{是否声明了替代关系}\n  H --&gt;|压盖 supersede| I[先关闭旧行&lt;br/&gt;再插入新行]\n  H --&gt;|未声明| J[拒绝并返回&lt;br/&gt;冲突候选列表]\n  I --&gt; K[记录关联ID&lt;br/&gt;审计可回溯]\n  J --&gt; L[进入人工裁决队列]</pre><p>最可靠的落地方式是<strong>把不变量交给数据库，而不是交给应用代码</strong>。PostgreSQL 的范围类型与排斥约束（exclusion constraint）可以在存储引擎层直接拒绝区间重叠：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS btree_gist;&#10;&#10;ALTER TABLE price_list_entry&#10;  ADD CONSTRAINT no_overlap&#10;  EXCLUDE USING gist (&#10;    price_key     WITH =,&#10;    daterange(valid_from, valid_to, &#39;[)&#39;) WITH &amp;&amp;&#10;  ) WHERE (status = &#39;active&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXTENSION </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> btree_gist;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_list_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> no_overlap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  EXCLUDE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gist (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    price_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    daterange(valid_from, valid_to, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段声明的含义是：同一个 <code>price_key</code> 下，任意两个 <code>active</code> 行的日期范围不得 <code>&amp;&amp;</code>（重叠）。<code>&#39;[)&#39;</code> 指定左闭右开，与上面的判定式严格一致。<code>WHERE (status=&#39;active&#39;)</code> 让被软删除或已作废的行不参与约束，否则历史行会永久锁死主键（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/rangetypes.html\">PostgreSQL, Range Types</a>；<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-createtable.html\">CREATE TABLE, EXCLUDE</a>）。</p>\n<p>这一层的价值在于<strong>它挡住的是并发</strong>。应用层的&quot;先查再插&quot;在并发下是经典的竞态：两个事务同时查到&quot;无冲突&quot;，然后同时插入，两边都成功。数据库排斥约束在提交时排序、冲突即回滚，是唯一能真正闭环的地方。若不用 PostgreSQL，等价的形态是 SQL:2011 定义的应用时段时态表（application-time period tables）与 <code>OVERLAPS</code> 谓词（ISO/IEC 9075-2:2011），或手工在唯一索引上叠加触发器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解决策略-拒绝-优先-压盖与拆分\">解决策略：拒绝、优先、压盖与拆分</h2><p>检测只回答&quot;有没有冲突&quot;，消解要回答&quot;谁来赢&quot;。四类策略对应四类业务意图，选错会让模型在后端塌掉。</p>\n<p>**拒绝（reject）**是默认姿态，也是最安全的。冲突时不写入，返回候选行列表交人工裁决。适用于财务口径、法务敏感价（如含税价、监管价）。</p>\n<p>**优先（precedence）**只消解第四类跨层冲突，不消解同层重叠。它是取价时的确定性函数，例如按&quot;客户专属 &gt; 区域 &gt; 渠道 &gt; 全球基准&quot;排序，同级再按数值最大的 <code>specificity</code> 打分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>level</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>scope</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(r) = w_1 \\cdot \\text{level}(r) + w_2 \\cdot \\text{scope}(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">level</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重一经发布即冻结，改动权重等同于改动所有历史取价结果，必须走版本与审批。</p>\n<p><strong>压盖（supersede）<strong>处理的是&quot;我有意用新行覆盖旧行的一段&quot;。语义上不是插入，而是两件事的原子组合：先把旧行的 <code>valid_to</code> 截断到新行的 <code>valid_from</code>（关闭旧行），再插入新行，并在两行上互记 <code>superseded_by</code> / <code>supersedes</code> 关联 ID。若旧行区间与新行区间并非&quot;尾段覆盖&quot;，截断会产生空洞，此时应改为</strong>拆分</strong>——把旧行一分为二，中间留给新行。压盖与拆分都必须<strong>在一次事务内</strong>完成，否则中途失败会留下区间空洞（有主键却无有效行），下游取价直接报&quot;无价&quot;。</p>\n<p>**拆分（split）**是唯一会产生&quot;一对多&quot;的形态，对审计不友好，因为它把一次变更放大成多条记录。建议只在确有必要时使用，且必须在变更单上留痕说明原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回滚不是删除-撤回-补偿与净额冲销\">回滚不是删除：撤回、补偿与净额冲销</h2><p>回滚的常见误解是&quot;把出错的那次变更删掉&quot;。在价格语境下这几乎总是错的，原因有三：删除会破坏已发布快照与历史取价的一致性；删除无法表达&quot;错误已经影响了 3000 张订单&quot;；删除后的主键可能被后来的行占用，导致区间无法复原。</p>\n<p>把回滚拆成三个语义层次，问题会清晰得多：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>对下游的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>撤回（withdraw）</strong></td>\n<td>变更尚未生效，作废版本</td>\n<td>生效日之前发现</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>回退（revert）</strong></td>\n<td>恢复到上一版本，生成<strong>新版本</strong>而非抹除旧版本</td>\n<td>生效后短期内、无下游消费</td>\n<td>新快照发布，下游重拉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>补偿（compensate）</strong></td>\n<td>保留错误行，追加反向调整</td>\n<td>已产生订单/发票/结算</td>\n<td>需对账与净额冲销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>回退的黄金法则是&quot;用新版本表达旧状态&quot;</strong>。这与 Stripe 的 Price 对象设计同构：Price 不可变，改价不是编辑而是归档旧的、创建新的（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/api/prices\">Stripe API, Prices</a>）。价格行也应如此——第 N+1 版本的内容等于第 N-1 版本，但版本号继续递增，审计链不断。抹除历史会让&quot;3 月对账文件里的价格从哪来&quot;这个提问永远无解。</p>\n<p><strong>补偿</strong>处理的是数字已经流出系统的情形。设某行错误价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{wrong}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{right}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，受影响订单数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则净额调整：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = \\sum_{i} (p_{right} - p_{wrong}) \\cdot q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个差额不是价格行的编辑，而是一张独立的调整单（借项/贷项通知），走财务流程。把它伪装成&quot;改价格&quot;，等于让价格表承担它不该承担的会计职责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回滚执行路径与恢复点选择\">回滚执行路径与恢复点选择</h2><p>具体怎么退，取决于系统保留了哪一层恢复能力。三条路径的代价与可靠性差异巨大。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  X[发现错误价格] --&gt; Y{错误是否已进入快照}&#10;  Y --&gt;|否, 仅草稿| Z[作废草稿版本&lt;br/&gt;零成本]&#10;  Y --&gt;|是| W{下游是否已消费}&#10;  W --&gt;|否| V[基于上一快照&lt;br/&gt;重建新版本]&#10;  W --&gt;|是| U[生成补偿调整单&lt;br/&gt;+ 修复当前有效行]&#10;  V --&gt; T[发布新快照&lt;br/&gt;哈希重新计算]&#10;  U --&gt; T&#10;  T --&gt; S[通知渠道重拉&lt;br/&gt;或推送差异]&#10;  S --&gt; R[对账核验&lt;br/&gt;历史取价重放]\">flowchart TD\n  X[发现错误价格] --&gt; Y{错误是否已进入快照}\n  Y --&gt;|否, 仅草稿| Z[作废草稿版本&lt;br/&gt;零成本]\n  Y --&gt;|是| W{下游是否已消费}\n  W --&gt;|否| V[基于上一快照&lt;br/&gt;重建新版本]\n  W --&gt;|是| U[生成补偿调整单&lt;br/&gt;+ 修复当前有效行]\n  V --&gt; T[发布新快照&lt;br/&gt;哈希重新计算]\n  U --&gt; T\n  T --&gt; S[通知渠道重拉&lt;br/&gt;或推送差异]\n  S --&gt; R[对账核验&lt;br/&gt;历史取价重放]</pre><p><strong>快照重建</strong>是最干净的一条：若系统为每次发布都冻结了不可变快照（含内容哈希），回滚就是&quot;把上一份快照的内容重新发布成新版本&quot;。前提是快照层与有效行层分离。这直接呼应本 hub 的姊妹篇 <a href=\"price-list-versioning-and-snapshot\">价格版本模型与快照</a>——快照的意义在回滚时才真正兑现：它把&quot;恢复到某个过去状态&quot;从推断变成复制。</p>\n<p>**前向修复（forward repair）**用于无法回退的场景。此时价格行被直接修正，但必须同时补齐三件事：修正动作本身的版本记录、对已消费部分的补偿单、以及一份说明为何不能回退的取证说明。前向修复的危险在于它使&quot;当前有效行&quot;与&quot;历史快照&quot;永久分歧，凡是有重放需求的下游（对账、审计、返利计算）都必须被告知这一分歧的存在。</p>\n<p><strong>恢复点选择</strong>是一个常被忽略的决策：回滚到&quot;上一个版本&quot;未必正确，若上一版本本身也含未发现的错误，回到它会制造二次事故。稳妥做法是回滚到<strong>最后一个通过独立核验的版本</strong>（known-good），而非简单的 N-1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等-审计与取证-让回滚可被证明\">幂等、审计与取证：让回滚可被证明</h2><p>回滚操作本身也会失败、超时、被重试。如果回滚不幂等，一次超时重试可能把旧行关闭两次，或生成两张重复的补偿单。</p>\n<p>三个工程约束能挡住绝大多数事故。<strong>其一，每次变更携带幂等键</strong>（通常由变更单号 + 目标版本号派生），重复提交返回同一结果而非重复执行。<strong>其二，所有写路径禁止 <code>UPDATE</code> 覆盖历史列</strong>，只允许&quot;关闭旧行 + 插入新行&quot;的追加写；<code>valid_to</code> 的截断是唯一例外，且必须与插入同事务。<strong>其三，审计事件只追加、不修改</strong>，事件流记录&quot;谁在何时把哪一行从什么状态改成什么状态&quot;，可被独立重放。</p>\n<p>取证层面，回滚需要能回答三个问题：原错误何时生效、影响了哪些时间段、现在是否已完全补偿。这要求系统保留<strong>时间轴</strong>而非仅仅保留当前状态——即每次取价都能重放&quot;某日某单据为何得到此价&quot;。这是时态建模相对普通 CRUD 的核心增值，也是 SQL:2011 系统版本时态表（system-versioned tables）被引入的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境特有问题-多币种-多法域与历史价重算\">跨境特有问题：多币种、多法域与历史价重算</h2><p>跨境的回滚比单市场复杂，因为&quot;恢复旧价&quot;在不同法域下含义不同。</p>\n<p><strong>监管价不可自由回滚。</strong> 欧盟《价格标示指令》98/6/EC 要求面向消费者的商品标示单位价格，而《Omnibus 指令》(EU) 2019/2161 进一步要求促销必须展示<strong>促销前一定期间内的最低价</strong>（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2019/2161/oj\">EUR-Lex, Directive (EU) 2019/2161</a>）。这意味着&quot;历史价&quot;不是内部数据，而是对消费者公开的、有法律含义的事实。一次错误回滚若改动了这段历史，可能构成误导性标示。此类场景下，回滚应以<strong>新增更正说明</strong>的方式表达，而非静默改写历史。</p>\n<p><strong>税率变更是外生的、不可回滚的。</strong> 日本消费税税率调整、各国 VAT/GST 变更由法规驱动，系统无法&quot;回滚&quot;税率，只能按生效日切换并保证跨税率日的单据按各自当时的税率计算。价格表回滚必须与税率版本解耦，否则一次价格回滚会错误地连带撤回税率的时点事实。</p>\n<p><strong>多币种使净额调整依赖当时汇率。</strong> 补偿计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 若用当前汇率折算历史订单，会产生汇率损益，与价格错误混在一起无法区分。正确做法是<strong>按订单原始成交汇率</strong>折算，汇率损益单独列示。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道侧的最终一致性。</strong> 价格分发的下游——平台后台（如 Amazon、Shopify 的 price list 机制）、ERP、自建商城——各自有同步延迟。回滚发布后，各渠道进入一个短暂的不一致窗口。工程上应把&quot;已发布&quot;与&quot;各渠道已确认&quot;分开追踪，回滚的成功判定以<strong>所有受控渠道回执确认</strong>为准，而非以发布动作完成为准。这需要每渠道的同步状态机与对账任务，是回滚可靠性中最容易低估的一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>冲突检测的底线是数据库层的区间不变量，冲突消解的底线是明确的优先级与压盖语义，回滚的底线是<strong>永不抹除历史、用新版本表达旧状态</strong>。三者叠加，价格表才能同时满足&quot;取价唯一&quot;与&quot;历史可证&quot;这两个看似矛盾的要求。跨境场景额外引入监管价不可改写、税率外生于价格、多币种补偿需按原成交汇率折算、渠道回执才算回滚完成四条约束，任一条被忽略都会让一次局部修复演变成一次合规事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 姊妹篇 <a href=\"price-list-versioning-and-snapshot\">价格版本模型与快照</a>：版本、生效期、快照三个正交维度的建模基础。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/rangetypes.html\">PostgreSQL Range Types 与 Exclusion Constraints</a>：区间排斥约束的权威实现参考。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2019/2161/oj\">EUR-Lex, Directive (EU) 2019/2161</a>：促销前最低价披露义务，决定跨境场景下历史价的法律地位。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生效重叠冲突与回滚","id":"生效重叠冲突与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：冲突、消解、回滚","id":"核心概念-冲突-消解-回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突的四种形态：不是所有重叠都一样严重","id":"冲突的四种形态-不是所有重叠都一样严重"},{"level":2,"text":"检测模型：半开区间、排斥约束与提交时校验","id":"检测模型-半开区间-排斥约束与提交时校验"},{"level":2,"text":"解决策略：拒绝、优先、压盖与拆分","id":"解决策略-拒绝-优先-压盖与拆分"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚不是删除：撤回、补偿与净额冲销","id":"回滚不是删除-撤回-补偿与净额冲销"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚执行路径与恢复点选择","id":"回滚执行路径与恢复点选择"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等、审计与取证：让回滚可被证明","id":"幂等-审计与取证-让回滚可被证明"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境特有问题：多币种、多法域与历史价重算","id":"跨境特有问题-多币种-多法域与历史价重算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"生效区间与未来价调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-version-effective/effective-dating-and-future-price-scheduling"},"next":{"title":"价格变更审批流与职责分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-approval-distribution/price-change-approval-workflow-and-segregation"}}